    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Rested; more energy</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or palpitations</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mood mostly good; still watchful in crowds; no suicidal ideation</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
